          "lines": [
            "          128        Kandihmei Guay Lwmlou La tho",
            "                                   8.8.8.8.Ref. 8. 8.8",
            "",
            "          1. Kandihmei guay lwmlou la tho;",
            "             Kaganv maek khe lungh laic la tho:",
            "             Jisu rui ryanraana kros khou,",
            "             Paapc phunghmei nunc khang theiclou the.",
            "",
            "                  Kalvari khou ryanraa khaengvlou;",
            "                  Kandihmei paap zaeng khang ruina,",
            "                  Kapanty tei tii patlou the.",
            "",
            "          2. Aniw ta nzianpui zaeng rui,",
            "             Kanac Mpouh ta tiilou the;",
            "             Heic tei rui aniw paap kuaklou.",
            "             Nchumhmei khou zaylou dat the.",
            "",
            "          3. Nang khang akhang e kaguay tei;",
            "             Lwmlou la tho nwan phunghmei guay;",
            "             Charynpui tuang e karamzian,",
            "             Saa ngam mak ge karamzian tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
